@startuml
left to right direction

[*] --> Dashboard
Dashboard : Registered user\nviewing Home

Dashboard --> InputBasicInfo : User taps\nAdd path

state InputBasicInfo {
  InputBasicInfo : Enter Origin & Destination\nEnter Total Duration\nSelect Date
}

InputBasicInfo --> ReconstructingPath : Next Step

state ReconstructingPath {
  ReconstructingPath : Search & Add Streets\nto build route sequence
}

ReconstructingPath --> ReconstructingPath : Add next street

ReconstructingPath --> AnnotatingSegments : Path Complete

state AnnotatingSegments {
  AnnotatingSegments : Select a street from list\nAdd specific anomaly\n(e.g., Pothole)
}

AnnotatingSegments --> AnnotatingSegments : Add another report

AnnotatingSegments --> Saving : Submit Trip
ReconstructingPath --> Saving : Submit Trip\n(No anomalies to report)

state Saving {
  Saving : Validate Topology\nUpdate User History
}

Saving --> [*]
@enduml